Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Talis\">talis deck</a></span> is by getting to know it as you would a person - one exceptionally long-lived and wise. The more time you spend in close observation of your deck, the more its arcana will philter in and and out you like air.\n</p><p><br>\nit's not for the deck to reveal itself for you; it's for you to reveal to yourself through the powerful symbols and ancient wisdom portrayed in these seventy-eight cards.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715165329\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.048 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.050 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1450/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 27560/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7748/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 938171/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   39.464      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   39.464      1 -total\n 48.76%   19.243      6 Template:Icon_text\n 42.78%   16.883     15 Template:Trim\n 22.92%    9.047      2 Template:Uid\n 16.54%    6.527      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.60%    5.369      2 Template:Icon_link\n 13.47%    5.314      2 Template:Template_style\n 11.74%    4.632      1 Template:PageSeo\n 11.49%    4.535      2 Template:Hidden_code\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:35682-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715165329 and revision id 374088. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}